      "role": "user",
      "content": "a \"green tea pill\" or plant-based progesterone?? i've never even heard of those being used for contraception before... are they actually as reliable as the regular pill? i'm worried that if i switch to these natural things, they won't work as well and i'll end up having a baby i'm not ready for. can you explain how those supplements actually prevent pregnancy?",
